`settings.json` should use the same syntax as the [API already uses](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/compaction#parameters): 

````json
{
    "context_management": {
        "edits": [
            {
                "type": "compact_20260112",
                "trigger": {
                    "type": "input_tokens",
                    "value": 150000
                },
            }
        ]
    }
}
````
